#!/usr/bin/env bash
# mcp-prompt-injection-detector — entry pointer.
# Primary deployable is the FastAPI MCP security gateway served from
# mcp_server_only.ipynb (standalone server cell). The detector workflow runs in
# mcp_prompt_injection_prevention.ipynb. bin/run documents the deploy path;
# use bin/check to validate repo + data integrity.
set -euo pipefail
cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."
cat <<'EOF'
This detector is a Jupyter-workflow repo (academic submission). To deploy the MCP
security gateway, execute the server cell of mcp_server_only.ipynb (FastAPI server).

A build-free server is not shipped as a source entry point; the standalone FastAPI
deployment notebook is the server. Run `bin/check` to validate data + notebook integrity.
EOF